# scitex-msword environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` and edit; .env is gitignored. Every variable here is
# strictly OPTIONAL — the package has sensible defaults and most
# users do not need to set any of these.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# SCITEX_MSWORD_CONFIG
#
# Path to a YAML config file consumed by the `scitex-msword` CLI in
# preference to ./config.yaml and ~/.scitex/msword/config.yaml. Used by
# the CLI to override profile defaults, default I/O paths, and table-
# insertion presets (font, column widths, header styling).
#
# Precedence (highest -> lowest):
#   1. Explicit CLI flags
#   2. ./pyproject.toml [tool.scitex_msword]
#   3. ./config.yaml (project-local)
#   4. $SCITEX_MSWORD_CONFIG (this variable)
#   5. ~/.scitex/msword/config.yaml (user-wide)
#   6. Built-in defaults
#
# Example:
#   SCITEX_MSWORD_CONFIG=/abs/path/to/my-sxm-config.yaml
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# SCITEX_MSWORD_CONFIG=
